      "description": "You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Housekeeper - Stadium MIAMI GARDENS, FL 33054 Apply Overview Position Type Full Time Apply St. Thomas University - Physical Plant Position Summary: The Housekeeper is responsible for maintaining cleanliness, sanitation, and overall appearance of assigned areas on campus, including classrooms, offices, restrooms, hallways, and dormitories. This position helps ensure a clean and safe environment for students, staff, and visitors. Key Responsibilities: Sweep, mop, and vacuum floors Clean and sanitize restrooms, including sinks, toilets, mirrors, and floors Empty trash and recycling bins and replace liners Dust furniture, window sills, and other surfaces Restock restroom supplies (toilet paper, soap, paper towels) Clean windows, walls, and doors as needed Report any maintenance issues or safety hazards Follow all safety and cleaning protocols Assist with event setup and cleanup when required Qualifications Qualifications: High school diploma or equivalent preferred Previous housekeeping or janitorial experience is a plus Ability to lift up to 40 lbs and stand for long periods Must be reliable, punctual, and able to work independently or as part of a team Must be able to follow written and verbal instructions Work Schedule: Flexible shifts available. May include evenings or weekends based on campus needs. Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
